        "line": 2441,
        "id": "vol1/b114.ks.scn/0/dialogue/215",
        "speaker": "凛凛花",
        "text": "我开动了——！！"
      },
      {
        "line": 2443,
        "id": "vol1/b114.ks.scn/0/dialogue/217",
        "speaker": "旁白（通常是夏生视角）",
        "text": "饿着肚子的凛凛花扑向了龙司带来的饭菜。"
      },
      {
        "line": 2444,
        "id": "vol1/b114.ks.scn/0/dialogue/218",
        "speaker": "亚托莉",
        "text": "好像很好吃……（咽口水）"
      },
      {
        "line": 2445,
        "id": "vol1/b114.ks.scn/0/dialogue/219",
        "speaker": "凛凛花",
        "text": "小跟班你要吃吗？"
      },
      {
        "line": 2446,
        "id": "vol1/b114.ks.scn/0/dialogue/220",
        "speaker": "亚托莉",
        "text": "可以吗！"
      },
      {
        "line": 2447,
        "id": "vol1/b114.ks.scn/0/dialogue/221",
        "speaker": "夏生",
        "text": "你吃什么吃啊，又不能摄取营养"
      },
      {
        "line": 2449,
        "id": "vol1/b114.ks.scn/0/dialogue/223",
        "speaker": "夏生",
        "text": "知道了，安静点。回去之后弄点东西给你吃"
      }
